@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Authenticated Feedback and Admin Notification

actor User
participant "React Feedback Page" as FE
participant "Feedback Route" as FR
database "Prisma / PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Notification Service" as NS
participant "Admin" as Admin

User -> FE: Enter type and description
FE -> FE: Validate type and minimum 5 chars
alt invalid input
  FE --> User: Show validation message
else valid input
  FE -> FR: POST /api/feedback + auth token
  FR -> FR: authenticateToken
  FR -> FR: Use token user id (ignore body userId)
  alt unauthenticated
    FR --> FE: 401 unauthorized
  else authenticated
    FR -> DB: Create feedback(userId, type, description)
    DB --> FR: Feedback record
    FR -> NS: notifyAdminsForFeedback(feedback)
    NS -> DB: Create Admin notification rows
    NS --> Admin: In-app feedback alert
    FR --> FE: 201 created feedback
    FE --> User: Show submission success
  end
end

Admin -> FE: Open feedback management
FE -> FR: GET /api/feedback
FR -> DB: Admin reads all; user reads own
DB --> FR: Feedback records
FR --> FE: Feedback list and submitter details
@enduml
